# Task: send a low-urgency desktop notification with a four-second expiry.
# Program: this file.
# Run: execute docs/recipes/desktop-notify-message.program --input summary="Build finished"
# Test with fakes: the notify.send applet is an injectable manifest. Point it at a fake
#   executable that records its arguments; expect summary, urgency low and expire_ms 4000.
# Explain: the notification has no action button. Use examples/desktop/notify-osd.program
#   when the program must read the chosen action.
# Replaces (Bash): notify-send -u low -t 4000 "$1"
accept summary as text
run notify.send with summary summary and urgency "low" and expire_ms 4000
